{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":16,"ref":"genesis 42:16","book":"genesis","lang":"pcm","chapter":42,"translation":"Make una send one from among una, make e carry ⟨את⟩ una broda; but una, make dem tie una down, make dem test una words — weda truth ⟨dey⟩ ⟨את⟩ ⟨wit⟩ una. And if no, ⟨as⟩ Paroh dey alive, sey una be spies!","tokens":[{"surface":"שלחו","gloss":"make una send"},{"surface":"מכם","gloss":"from among una"},{"surface":"אחד","gloss":"one"},{"surface":"ויקח","gloss":"make e carry"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"una broda"},{"surface":"אחיכם","gloss":"una broda"},{"surface":"ואתם","gloss":"but una"},{"surface":"האסרו","gloss":"make dem tie una down"},{"surface":"ויבחנו","gloss":"make dem test"},{"surface":"דבריכם","gloss":"una words"},{"surface":"האמת","gloss":"weda truth"},{"surface":"אתכם","gloss":"⟨את⟩ ⟨wit⟩ una"},{"surface":"ואם","gloss":"and if"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"no"},{"surface":"חי","gloss":"⟨as⟩ … dey alive"},{"surface":"פרעה","gloss":"Paroh"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"sey"},{"surface":"מרגלים","gloss":"spies"},{"surface":"אתם","gloss":"una be"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-11T14:20:49.513608535Z","model":"glm-5.2"}